# #1171: a module whose function takes the GENERIC call path (it binds a
# local, so it is not a frameless leaf accessor). load_file frees the module's
# creator chunk after the body runs, so the function is the ONLY holder of
# its chunk: a call that drops its callee before the new frame holds the
# chunk runs freed code. It deliberately ends in the define: load_file then
# returns this shared function while another worker can update its refcount,
# exercising the builtin-result view check from #1868. Loaded by
# tests/rebind_call_race.eigs and tests/loader_mt_define_result.eigs.
define lm_gen_fn(x) as:
    local y is x * 2
    return y
